Create a new Theme App Extension block for the cart page in the Zip Code Checker app at /Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Shopify App/Zip-Code.

## Step 1: Read existing files first
1. `extensions/zip-code-widget/shopify.extension.toml` — understand the current block registration format
2. `extensions/zip-code-widget/blocks/zip-code-checker.liquid` — lines 56-110 — understand how the existing block loads config from metafield (metafield key, format, fallback)
3. `extensions/zip-code-widget/locales/en.default.json` — existing localization structure

